{"t":"Draconia Quest/Spoiler","s":"draconia-quest-spoiler-8b57a","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Draconia_Route_b41bc5.png","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Draconia Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">25<br/>(25+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.2<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 10, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>You will need to solve riddles to get the keys and go up in the pyramid.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Draconia\">Draconia</a>, through <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgate\">Hellgate</a>, near <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeletons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghouls</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">Demon Skeletons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Mummy\">Mummies</a> and a possible lure of one or more <a href=\"#/wiki/Elder%20Bonelord\">Elder Bonelords</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Rapier\">Ice Rapier</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Serpent%20Sword\">Serpent Sword</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Skin%20Amulet\">Stone Skin Amulet</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Ring\">Energy Ring</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\";\"><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Please review this page.</p><br/><p>This page may need to be updated for content, grammar, spelling, language, etc.</p><p style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:x-small;\">Please remove this template after the page has been raised to appropriate standards of quality.</p></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Useful_Items\">Useful Items</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203012\">Key 3012</a> Hellgate Entrance Key</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field\">Destroy Field</a> runes</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\">White Mushroom</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This quest involves 9 keys, including <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203012\">Key 3012</a> for accessing <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgate\">Hellgate</a>. The <a href=\"#/wiki/Draconia\">Draconia</a> keys are all silver and numbered from 3001 - 3008 inclusive and the number corresponds to when they are used, the lowest number being found and used first. For information on specific keys, see the corresponding articles for keys <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203001\">3001</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203002\">3002</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203003\">3003</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203004\">3004</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203005\">3005</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203006\">3006</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203007\">3007</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203008\">3008</a>.</li>\n<li>Most of the keys found in this quest are daily respawns. If somebody has already collected the keys, you will need to find another means of obtaining them (i.e. buying or borrowing).</li>\n<li>You cannot finish this quest alone. You will need at least 1 other trustworthy player to stand on floor switches, and there is a possibility of being trapped if you trust the wrong players.</li>\n<li>If for any reason anyone cannot complete the quest, there are 2 ways to escape back to <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a>:\n<ul><li>In exchange for a <a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\">White Mushroom</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/An%20Old%20Dragonlord\">An Old Dragonlord</a> can give you a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragonfetish\">Dragonfetish</a> which can be used to teleport out,</li>\n<li>It is possible to leave by going back to <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgate\">Hellgate</a> and leaving by the standard, levitation route (which happens to be very close to <a href=\"#/wiki/Draconia\">Draconia</a>'s entrance).</li></ul></li>\n<li>This quest can take a long time, it is advised at least 50 minutes time. If you have the keys ahead of time the quest can be significantly shorter.</li>\n<li>Consider getting the book for the <a href=\"#/quest/realm-of-dreams-quest\">Realm of Dreams Quest</a> while at <a href=\"#/wiki/Draconia\">Draconia</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Starting off in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a>, find the <a href=\"#/wiki/Shadow%20Caves\">Shadow Caves</a> (north-west the depot underground, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32655,31670,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32655, 31670, 8)</a>).</li>\n<li>Go down 2 more floors and follow the cave south and then east. You should find a (normally locked) door, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgate\">Hellgate</a> entrance (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32676,31671,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32676, 31671, 10)</a>). Open the door with <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203012\">Key 3012</a> and go in (if you don't have key 3012 you can buy one from <a href=\"#/wiki/Elathriel\">Elathriel</a>, the nearby prison guard, for 5000gp).</li>\n<li>Enter the northern teleport to enter <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgate\">Hellgate</a>.</li>\n<li>Follow the images below to reach <a href=\"#/wiki/Draconia\">Draconia</a>. You may encounter <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeletons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Spider\">Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghouls</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworms</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Carrion%20Worm\">Carrion Worms</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm%20Queen\">Rotworm Queen</a> (rarely), <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime\">Slimes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord\">Bonelords</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">Demon Skeletons</a>. It is possible to encounter some lured <a href=\"#/wiki/Elder%20Bonelord\">Elder Bonelords</a> as well. Encountering anything else is a sign that you took a wrong turn.</li>\n<li>The map does not direct you to the surface, it will end at <a href=\"#/wiki/Redbone%20Castle\">Redbone Castle</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32666,31672,15\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32666, 31672, 15)</a>). However, the path beyond the map is one-way so you cannot be misguided.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Draconia Route\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"1196\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Route_b41bc5.png\" width=\"465\"/></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Ground_Floor\">Ground Floor</span></h3>\n<p>This floor (inside the pyramid) has many <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">skeletons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\">scorpions</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203001\">Key 3001</a>: from the hole, walk to the north-west side of the pyramid. Open the skeleton corpses to find <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203001\">Key 3001</a>. You may have to move a few corpses before you find the right skeleton corpse.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203002\">Key 3002</a>: return to the hole you came from and walk south. Open the eastern door with key 3001 and walk north to find a red carpet. Walk along the south row of the carpet. Carpet tiles will burn and electrify you - and 2 tiles are hidden holes which drop down to 10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\">scorpions</a>. On the other side of the carpet, open the second coffin on the north side of the room to find <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203002\">Key 3002</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203003\">Key 3003</a>: go back to key 3001's location and walk south, to the south-west part of the pyramid. Open the door with key 3002 and pull the lever. Go north again and pull another lever (the lever destroyed a wall blocking its access). Again go south where the rock will have disappeared. Pick up <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203003\">Key 3003</a>.</li>\n<li>Now go back around and use key 3003 on the western door in the south-east corner of the pyramid. Follow through to the staircase.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"885e6de167087576080294cd16df4a98\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_0-gif\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:172px; top:0.5px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_0_540633.gif\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest 0.gif (11 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_Key_3001-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:135px; width:185px; top:25px;\"><img alt=\"Search the skeleton corpses for Key 3001. You may have to remove a few corpses before you find the key.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Search the skeleton corpses for . You may have to remove a few corpses before you find the key.\" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_Key_3001_5e6f5a.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest Key 3001.png (269 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Search the skeleton corpses for <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203001\">Key 3001</a>. You may have to remove a few corpses before you find the key.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_Key_3002_1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:135px; width:185px; top:25px;\"><img alt=\"Walk along the red carpet - watch out for the holes (they appear only once you fall through them).\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Walk along the red carpet - watch out for the holes (they appear only once you fall through them).\" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_Key_3002_1_667454.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest Key 3002 1.png (194 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Walk along the red carpet - watch out for the holes (they appear only once you fall through them).</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_Key_3002_2-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:135px; width:185px; top:25px;\"><img alt=\"Open the coffin to find Key 3002.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Open the coffin to find .\" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_Key_3002_2_a48067.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest Key 3002 2.png (130 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Open the coffin to find <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203002\">Key 3002</a>.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_Key_3003_1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:135px; width:185px; top:25px;\"><img alt=\"Pull the lever to destroy the wall north.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Pull the lever to destroy the wall north.\" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_Key_3003_1_0da079.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest Key 3003 1.png (241 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Pull the lever to destroy the wall north.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_Key_3003_2-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:135px; width:185px; top:25px;\"><img alt=\"Pull the lever behind the (now destroyed) wall to destroy the stone.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Pull the lever behind the (now destroyed) wall to destroy the stone.\" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_Key_3003_2_bf3720.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest Key 3003 2.png (208 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Pull the lever behind the (now destroyed) wall to destroy the stone.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_Key_3003_3-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:135px; width:185px; top:25px;\"><img alt=\"Go back and pick up Key 3003\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Go back and pick up \" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_Key_3003_3_ab11bb.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest Key 3003 3.png (252 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Go back and pick up <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203003\">Key 3003</a></div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Second_Floor\">Second Floor</span></h3>\n<p>Here you will find <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">skeletons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">ghouls</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203004\">Key 3004</a>: from the staircase, go south and east. You will see a room filled with <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Field\">Energy Fields</a>. Use <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field\">Destroy Field</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Browse%20Field\">Browse Field</a> on the tile in the first row, third column. <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203004\">Key 3004</a> will be revealed.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203005\">Key 3005</a>: from key 3004's location, go south. Open the door south with key 3004, inside the room go west and follow the path to find <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203005\">Key 3005</a> laying on the ground next to the statues.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203006\">Key 3006</a>: go back to the stairs you came from, and this time go west. Open the door with key 3005 and you will find another room with fields in it - this time fire with some energy. Use a destroy field rune or Browse Field on the south-easternmost tile to reveal <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203006\">Key 3006</a>. Pick it up.</li>\n<li>Go back to the south and enter the final locked door using key 3006. Go up the ladder.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"1\" hash=\"896a62b605104499b8b111914a7be3be\" id=\"w-gallery-1\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_2-gif\" style=\"position: relative; height:158px; width:171px; top:13.5px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"158\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_2_73af71.gif\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest 2.gif (4 KB)\" width=\"171\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_Key_3004-gif\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:134px; top:0.5px;\"><img alt=\"Key 3004 is found under an energy field on the top row, third column.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Key 3004 is found under an energy field on the top row, third column.\" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_Key_3004_eed98d.gif\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest Key 3004.gif (138 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Key 3004 is found under an energy field on the top row, third column.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_Key_3005-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:135px; width:185px; top:25px;\"><img alt=\"Key 3005 is found on the ground in the south-west room. You need key 3004 to get here.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Key 3005 is found on the ground in the south-west room. You need key 3004 to get here.\" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_Key_3005_c3a254.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest Key 3005.png (274 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Key 3005 is found on the ground in the south-west room. You need key 3004 to get here.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_Key_3006-gif\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:105px; top:0.5px;\"><img alt=\"Key 3006 is found under a fire field in the north-west room. You need key 3005 to get here.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Key 3006 is found under a fire field in the north-west room. You need key 3005 to get here.\" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_Key_3006_363c04.gif\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest Key 3006.gif (41 KB)\" width=\"128\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Key 3006 is found under a fire field in the north-west room. You need key 3005 to get here.</div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Third_Floor\">Third Floor</span></h3>\n<p>This floor has 6-8 <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">ghouls</a> and 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">demon skeletons</a>. This is the part you need at least 2 people. This spoiler will assume the minimum of 2 people, although 3 players can do this each having a unique purpose.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203007\">Key 3007</a>: from the stairs, follow the path until you find two floor switches. Leave player 1 on the southern switch. Player 2 must now go west, enter the south-western room and step on the floor switch in there. Player 1 must then leave his stand, go west and then north to enter the portal and take <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203007\">Key 3007</a>.</li>\n<li>Player 1 must now go back to the floor switch they stood on before. Player 2 may then leave the room.</li>\n<li>Both players now go upstairs.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"2\" hash=\"85e72f48eaa94868a5fad62689e4e60e\" id=\"w-gallery-2\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:162px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_3-gif\" style=\"position: relative; height:160px; width:160px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"160\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_3_dc5a6e.gif\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest 3.gif (2 KB)\" width=\"160\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:162px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_Key_3007_1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:135px; width:185px; top:12.5px;\"><img alt=\"Player 1 stands here. The south-west room will open.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Player 1 stands here. The south-west room will open.\" height=\"160\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_Key_3007_1_a16ef1.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest Key 3007 1.png (132 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Player 1 stands here. The south-west room will open.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:162px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_Key_3007_2-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:135px; width:185px; top:12.5px;\"><img alt=\"Player 2 stands here. The north-west room will open.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Player 2 stands here. The north-west room will open.\" height=\"160\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_Key_3007_2_f9c6f1.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest Key 3007 2.png (233 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Player 2 stands here. The north-west room will open.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:162px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_Key_3007_3-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:135px; width:185px; top:12.5px;\"><img alt=\"Player 1 (or player 3) enters the portal.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Player 1 (or player 3) enters the portal.\" height=\"160\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_Key_3007_3_2f1e44.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest Key 3007 3.png (192 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Player 1 (or player 3) enters the portal.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:162px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_Key_3007_4-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:135px; width:185px; top:12.5px;\"><img alt=\"Player 1 (or player 3) takes the key.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Player 1 (or player 3) takes the key.\" height=\"160\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_Key_3007_4_66d665.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest Key 3007 4.png (189 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Player 1 (or player 3) takes the key.</div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Fourth_Floor\">Fourth Floor</span></h3>\n<p>This floor has about 7 <a href=\"#/wiki/Mummy\">mummies</a> and 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">demon skeletons</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Follow the path to the locked door.</li>\n<li>Open the door with <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203007\">Key 3007</a>.</li>\n<li>Continue through the door and go upstairs.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"3\" hash=\"e438a6497e6c67caaa5ef70d00b1e758\" id=\"w-gallery-3\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:98px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_4-gif\" style=\"position: relative; height:96px; width:100px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_4_20478b.gif\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest 4.gif (2 KB)\" width=\"100\"/></div></div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Fifth_Floor\">Fifth Floor</span></h3>\n<p>Fifth floor has 8 <a href=\"#/wiki/Mummy\">mummies</a> and 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime\">slimes</a>. There are no puzzles here, simply go through to the next floor.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"4\" hash=\"a7edb95674f49fb0f1260daab4b9a747\" id=\"w-gallery-4\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:85px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_5-gif\" style=\"position: relative; height:83px; width:89px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"83\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_5_026fc5.gif\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest 5.gif (1 KB)\" width=\"89\"/></div></div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sixth_Floor\">Sixth Floor</span></h3>\n<p>This floor has 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">demon skeletons</a> and 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Mummy\">mummies</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Open the chests behind the level 25 <a href=\"#/wiki/Gate%20of%20Expertise\">Gate of Expertise</a> for your reward.</li>\n<li>Open the western bookcase to get <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203008\">Key 3008</a> (quest, not a daily respawn—each player can get 1).</li>\n<li>Go upstairs</li></ul>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"5\" hash=\"eaa6ed7e3088ec00a5f79d8d6b98a5c9\" id=\"w-gallery-5\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:138px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_6-gif\" style=\"position: relative; height:80px; width:79px; top:28px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"80\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_6_c937f7.gif\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest 6.gif (1 KB)\" width=\"79\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:138px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_Key_3008-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:136px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Get Key 3008 from the west bookcase.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Get  from the west bookcase.\" height=\"136\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_Key_3008_422ea5.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest Key 3008.png (207 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Get <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203008\">Key 3008</a> from the west bookcase.</div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Seventh_Floor\">Seventh Floor</span></h3>\n<p>There are no creatures here.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Open the door with <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203008\">Key 3008</a>.</li>\n<li>Arrange the levers: left-right-left-right.</li>\n<li>Enter the portal to arrive at <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a> sacrificial stone, near the <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple\">temple</a>.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"6\" hash=\"e0153e1f2b3a9a48a217ea899506e6d0\" id=\"w-gallery-6\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:138px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_Switches-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:136px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Arrange the switches: left-right-left-right. Enter the portal.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Arrange the switches: left-right-left-right. Enter the portal.\" height=\"136\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_Switches_af2615.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest Switches.png (200 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Arrange the switches: left-right-left-right. Enter the portal.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:138px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Draconia_Quest_Destination-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:136px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"You will appear here.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"You will appear here.\" height=\"136\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draconia_Quest_Destination_0a9620.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Draconia Quest Destination.png (401 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">You will appear here.</div></div></div></div>","quests":[]}